8:["$","p",null,{"children":["Across image and video generation, Sol-Attn advances the quality-efficiency frontier of training-free sparse attention, delivering up to ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"2.1×"}]," speedup for video generation and ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"2.3×"}]," for video editing while preserving visual quality. Integrated with complementary acceleration techniques in Sol-Engine, it reaches up to"," ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"5× end-to-end speedup"}],"."]}]
9:["$","section",null,{"className":"comparison-section","id":"comparison","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"comparison-inner section","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"comparison-heading","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow eyebrow-light","children":"Dense vs. Sol-Attn"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Visual comparisons."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Dense-attention and Sol-Attn outputs, aligned case by case."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"comparison-gallery","children":[[["$","article","ltx",{"className":"comparison-model","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"comparison-model-heading","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"LTX 2.3"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"1080p two-stage generation"}]]}],["$","strong",null,{"children":["1.90×"," end-to-end"]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"comparison-matrix-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"comparison-case-headings","children":[["$","div","Window light",{"className":"comparison-case-copy","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Window light"}],["$","details",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-disclosure","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-preview","children":"INT. QUIET APARTMENT BY TALL WINDOW - LATE AFTERNOON. A bright cinematic 85mm close-up frames a beautiful woman in a cream sweater beside white curtains and wooden blinds. Her complete face fills the frame, with soft skin texture, clear eyes, and a calm natural expression; the background is a warm blurred room with plants and books, not futuristic. She starts looking down in partial shade. As wind moves the curtains, horizontal bands of golden sunlight travel slowly across her cheek, lips, and eyes. She raises her chin and turns from left profile into a clear three-quarter view, then gives a subtle thoughtful smile. The camera makes a slow push-in at eye level. Elegant natural portrait lighting, warm highlights, visible head motion, clean subject-background separation, no hands near face, no text, no logos. Audio: curtain fabric moving, distant city ambience, soft breath."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-toggle","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-expand","children":"Show full prompt"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-collapse","children":"Collapse prompt"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-full","children":"INT. QUIET APARTMENT BY TALL WINDOW - LATE AFTERNOON. A bright cinematic 85mm close-up frames a beautiful woman in a cream sweater beside white curtains and wooden blinds. Her complete face fills the frame, with soft skin texture, clear eyes, and a calm natural expression; the background is a warm blurred room with plants and books, not futuristic. She starts looking down in partial shade. As wind moves the curtains, horizontal bands of golden sunlight travel slowly across her cheek, lips, and eyes. She raises her chin and turns from left profile into a clear three-quarter view, then gives a subtle thoughtful smile. The camera makes a slow push-in at eye level. Elegant natural portrait lighting, warm highlights, visible head motion, clean subject-background separation, no hands near face, no text, no logos. Audio: curtain fabric moving, distant city ambience, soft breath."}]]}]]}],["$","div","Projection room",{"className":"comparison-case-copy","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Projection room"}],["$","details",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-disclosure","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-preview","children":"INT. SMALL CINEMA PROJECTION ROOM - EVENING. A graceful female film archivist stands near an old projector in a tight 85mm portrait. Her full face is sharp and bright, with short wavy hair, natural pores, and a black turtleneck; dust particles sparkle in a cone of projector light behind her. She begins in side profile reading a film strip below frame. The projector starts, and a moving rectangle of warm flickering light sweeps across her face. She lifts her eyes and turns toward camera as the background alternates amber and cool shadow. The face remains dominant while film reels, shelves, and a round window blur behind her. Cinematic, tactile, elegant, strong light-on-face transition, no harsh cyberpunk styling, no text in focus, no hands in foreground. Audio: projector rattle, film reel clicking, room tone, one quiet inhale."}],"$Lb"]}],"$Lc"]}]]}],"$Ld"]}],"$Le"]}]]}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11"],"$L12"]}]]}]}]
