c:["$","p",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-full","children":"INT. SMALL CINEMA PROJECTION ROOM - EVENING. A graceful female film archivist stands near an old projector in a tight 85mm portrait. Her full face is sharp and bright, with short wavy hair, natural pores, and a black turtleneck; dust particles sparkle in a cone of projector light behind her. She begins in side profile reading a film strip below frame. The projector starts, and a moving rectangle of warm flickering light sweeps across her face. She lifts her eyes and turns toward camera as the background alternates amber and cool shadow. The face remains dominant while film reels, shelves, and a round window blur behind her. Cinematic, tactile, elegant, strong light-on-face transition, no harsh cyberpunk styling, no text in focus, no hands in foreground. Audio: projector rattle, film reel clicking, room tone, one quiet inhale."}]
d:["$","div","Rainy night",{"className":"comparison-case-copy","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Rainy night"}],["$","details",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-disclosure","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-preview","children":"INT. TAXI BACK SEAT - RAINY NIGHT, SOFT CITY LIGHTS. A close 85mm portrait observes a beautiful woman with shoulder-length hair by a rain-streaked taxi window. Her full face is bright and readable, with warm dashboard light on one side and cool street reflections on the other. She starts facing the window, eyes lowered, the city behind her reduced to creamy bokeh. As the taxi passes under a bridge, a sequence of amber, white, and blue light bands travels across her face. She turns her head toward camera and then looks past it, expression soft but alert. The camera remains intimate and stable with slight car motion. Realistic urban drama, face-first composition, strong light variation, clear head movement, no cyberpunk costume, no phone, no text. Audio: rain on glass, taxi turn signal, tires on wet road, quiet breath."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-toggle","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-expand","children":"Show full prompt"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-collapse","children":"Collapse prompt"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"comparison-prompt-full","children":"INT. TAXI BACK SEAT - RAINY NIGHT, SOFT CITY LIGHTS. A close 85mm portrait observes a beautiful woman with shoulder-length hair by a rain-streaked taxi window. Her full face is bright and readable, with warm dashboard light on one side and cool street reflections on the other. She starts facing the window, eyes lowered, the city behind her reduced to creamy bokeh. As the taxi passes under a bridge, a sequence of amber, white, and blue light bands travels across her face. She turns her head toward camera and then looks past it, expression soft but alert. The camera remains intimate and stable with slight car motion. Realistic urban drama, face-first composition, strong light variation, clear head movement, no cyberpunk costume, no phone, no text. Audio: rain on glass, taxi turn signal, tires on wet road, quiet breath."}]]}]]}]
